 "notes": [
  "Posted 13 May 2001, before Tatooine; the list has no Tatooine-set card, so the format is Premiere - Reflections II.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(8)': Bring Him Before Me / Take Your Father's Place, Death Star II: Throne Room, Your Destiny, Insignificant Rebellion, Prepared Defences (Prepared Defenses), Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order, Crush The Rebellion; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "The description calls this his undefeated states deck that earned runner-up; the strategy says it went undefeated in the Minnesota states through four games. Recorded as 2nd at the 2001 Minnesota State Championship. The same player's Light deck from that event is 'State Deck-Raveling's Euro-WYS' (DeckTech 15962).",
  "Posted 'Darth Vader w Saber' dested the Enhanced character Darth Vader With Lightsaber (listed under Characters; the strategy calls it 'Vader w Sabers', his Vader choice).",
  "Posted 'Death Star 2DB' dested Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'Executer DB' Executor: Docking Bay; 'Endor DB' the Dark Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); Kessel, Sullust and Endor the Dark system printings.",
  "Posted 'U-3Po' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Evader/Monnok' Evader & Monnok; 'Omni Box/Its Worse' Ommni Box & It's Worse; 'Chimeara' Chimaera; 'Devestator' Devastator; 'Executer' Executor.",
  "Secret Plans was an Effect in 2001 (not a Defensive Shield).",
  "Total is 60 as published."
